+
+#### [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
+> **Description:** Flowise is a visual builder for AI agents and LLM workflows, with a README centered on drag-and-drop orchestration, self-hosting, APIs, and integrations. That makes it useful for hotel teams that need to prototype concierge bots, internal staff copilots, itinerary planners, or property knowledge assistants without writing every workflow from scratch. Flowise exposes server, UI, and component layers in a monorepo, so technical teams can extend it after a low-code start. Its Apache-2.0 license and large community are appealing for hotel groups standardizing multiple AI workflows across brands or properties. GitHub metadata: last commit **2025-12-29**, **47.8k** stars, primary language **TypeScript**, license **Apache-2.0**.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
