+- **Last Commit:** 2025-12-29
+- **Category:** workflow builder, concierge, low-code
+- **Best for:** fast prototyping of hotel AI workflows and multi-step guest journeys
+
+---
+
+#### [Langflow](https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow)
+> **Description:** Langflow positions itself as a platform for building and deploying AI-powered agents and workflows with a visual authoring experience, built-in APIs, and MCP server support. That combination is practical for hotel operators who want a reservation assistant, restaurant booking helper, or internal SOP copilot exposed as an API to mobile apps, kiosks, or call-center tools. The README emphasizes observability, security, and integrations with major model providers and vector databases, which matters once pilots move into production. It is fully open source under MIT, and GitHub activity remains high. GitHub metadata: last commit **2026-01-03**, **142.7k** stars, primary language **Python**, license **MIT**.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/langflow-ai/langflow](https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow)
+- **Stars:** 142.7k ⭐
