+
+#### [Botpress](https://github.com/botpress/botpress)
+> **Description:** Botpress’s current repository is focused on the open-source hub around integrations, SDKs, CLI tooling, and bot examples used with the broader Botpress ecosystem. The README stresses public integrations, bots-as-code, and developer tooling for deploying assistants and plugins, which can still be useful for hospitality builders who want reusable connectors and programmable agent behavior. It is less of a turnkey self-hosted hotel concierge than Rasa or Flowise, but it remains a meaningful GitHub-based option for teams building custom guest journeys with code. The repository is MIT licensed and still actively updated. GitHub metadata: last commit **2026-01-08**, **14.6k** stars, primary language **TypeScript**, license **MIT**.
