+# Best AI Tools for Hotels in 2026
+
+[![Awesome](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sindresorhus/awesome@main/media/badge.svg)](https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome)
+[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
+![Topics](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/GagnDeep/awesome-best-ai-tools-for-hotels-2026?style=social)
+
+> Best AI tools for hotels in 2026 are mostly open-source building blocks rather than hotel-only products. This list curates verified GitHub repositories that hotels can self-host for concierge chat, guest messaging, voice automation, document extraction, booking knowledge search, and demand forecasting, while being honest about the gaps in hotel-native OSS.
+
+## Table of Contents
+- [TL;DR](#tldr)
