+> **Description:** Rasa is an open-source conversational AI framework for text and voice interactions, and its README focuses on building reliable AI agents that can handle real-world business logic. For hotels, that maps well to concierge, booking-intent routing, late check-in flows, multilingual FAQ handling, and escalation to human staff. The project supports dialogue management, integrations, and production deployment patterns rather than just demos. GitHub shows strong long-term adoption and an Apache-2.0 license, which makes it one of the safest choices for hospitality teams that want full control. GitHub metadata: last commit **2025-12-18**, **21.0k** stars, primary language **Python**, license **Apache-2.0**.
