+### Forecasting, Pricing & Demand Analytics
+
+#### [NeuralForecast](https://github.com/Nixtla/neuralforecast)
+> **Description:** NeuralForecast is a collection of scalable neural forecasting algorithms aimed at practical time-series modeling. Hotels can use it for occupancy forecasting, pickup curves, channel demand, staffing expectations, event-driven variance, and other non-linear demand patterns that may be hard to capture with simpler models. The README positions it as user-friendly while still giving access to modern neural methods, which makes it attractive for data teams that want better accuracy without building architectures from scratch. It is Apache-2.0 licensed, actively maintained, and one of the clearest OSS forecasting projects for hospitality demand planning. GitHub metadata: last commit **2026-01-14**, **3.9k** stars, primary language **Python**, license **Apache-2.0**.
