+#### [LibreChat](https://github.com/danny-avila/LibreChat)
+> **Description:** LibreChat is a self-hosted multi-model chat workspace with agents, MCP support, tool integrations, code interpreter options, search, presets, and secure multi-user access. Its README makes clear that it is more than a chatbot clone: it is an extensible front end for multiple AI providers and local endpoints. Hotels can use it as a staff-facing assistant for SOP lookup, incident triage, rate-policy Q&A, and knowledge search across documents. It is also suitable for private guest-support deployments when teams want a branded interface without relying on a hosted SaaS product. GitHub metadata: last commit **2025-12-05**, **32.1k** stars, primary language **TypeScript**, license **MIT**.
