+### Knowledge, RAG & Document Intelligence
+
+#### [AnythingLLM](https://github.com/Mintplex-Labs/anything-llm)
+> **Description:** AnythingLLM is an all-in-one desktop and Docker application for RAG, agents, document chat, MCP compatibility, and multi-user deployments. The README highlights workspaces, embeddable chat, developer APIs, support for both open and commercial models, and vector database flexibility. Hotels can use it to turn property manuals, event packets, menu PDFs, house rules, maintenance playbooks, and guest-facing FAQs into private searchable knowledge bases. The strong local-first and self-hosted story is especially useful for properties that do not want guest or operations data flowing through proprietary SaaS products. GitHub metadata: last commit **2026-01-14**, **53.3k** stars, primary language **JavaScript**, license **MIT**.
