+#### [Haystack](https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack)
+> **Description:** Haystack is an AI orchestration framework for production-ready LLM applications, with strong emphasis on RAG, document search, question answering, and customizable pipelines. The README makes it clear that the framework is designed for explicit, flexible component orchestration across models, databases, file converters, and deployment paths. For hotels, that is useful when a concierge agent has to combine policy lookup, room-type rules, restaurant data, local recommendations, and escalation workflows. Haystack is not the fastest way to prototype, but it is one of the clearest options for teams that need a rigorous Python framework and long-term architectural control. GitHub metadata: last commit **2026-01-09**, **23.8k** stars, primary language **MDX**, license **Apache-2.0**.
