+### LLM Serving, Routing & Integration
+
+Gap note: this category has fewer than 5 strong repos that are both widely adopted and clearly useful for hotel deployments without slipping into hosted or license-gray products.
+
+#### [LiteLLM](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)
+> **Description:** LiteLLM is positioned as both a Python SDK and an AI gateway for calling many LLM providers through a unified OpenAI-compatible interface. The README emphasizes routing, retries, load balancing, guardrails, spend tracking, logging, and centralized administration. For hotels, that is valuable when multiple assistants share one gateway across concierge chat, staff copilots, revenue analytics, and voice systems. It helps control model access and cost instead of wiring every hotel workflow to a different provider directly. LiteLLM fits especially well in multi-property environments where governance and provider switching matter as much as raw model quality. GitHub metadata: last commit **2025-11-18**, **41.6k** stars, primary language **Python**, license **MIT**.
