+
+> Best AI tools for hotels in 2026 are mostly open-source building blocks rather than hotel-only products. This list curates verified GitHub repositories that hotels can self-host for concierge chat, guest messaging, voice automation, document extraction, booking knowledge search, and demand forecasting, while being honest about the gaps in hotel-native OSS.
